              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "వంకాయ (vaṅkāya) is vaṅga, \"brinjal\", which DEDR 5301 lists with Kannada badane; and kāya, \"unripe fruit\". DEDR compares Sanskrit bhaṇṭākī, vaṅga and vṛntāka, \"brinjal\" (CDIAL 11503), names that CDIAL itself thinks probably go back to Dravidian."
            }
